---
title: "Articles"
description: "Articles, op-eds and news published by the JISR movement."
---
<section class="hero" style="padding-bottom:24px;">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="eyebrow">{{ t.nav.articles }}</span>
    <h1>Articles &amp; news</h1>
    <p class="lead">Personal journeys, op-eds, and news from the JISR movement.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section style="padding-top:0;">
  <div class="container">
    {% set posts = collections.articles_en %}
    {% if posts.length %}
      <div class="article-grid">
        {% for post in posts %}
          <a class="article-card" href="{{ post.url }}">
            <span class="date">{{ post.data.date | dateEn }}</span>
            <h3>{{ post.data.title }}</h3>
            <p>{{ post.data.description }}</p>
          </a>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    {% else %}
      <p class="empty-state">{{ t.noArticles }}</p>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</section>
